      "role": "user",
      "content": "support lines? what good would that do here? there's nothing left but ghosts and starvation. i just mean... there's no dignity in what's coming next. when they break through, there won't be anything left of our pride or our people. it just feels like the end is certain, and i'm just waiting for the noise to start.",
